{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_87", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": -10, "width": 3136, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1553714998, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 629653100, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_88", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 6, "width": 3092, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 116146606, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1280285447, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - NEW RENTAL INQUIRY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - NEW RENTAL INQUIRY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_89", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 42, "width": 3092, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 390887331, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1121481225, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The first of your text and email automations: someone asks about a car, gets a text back in seconds and an email with what they need to rent, and a follow-up the next day if they have not booked. The card opens under New Inquiry, the first of your headings in the opportunities tab, and texts go out once your GHL number's A2P registration is approved.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The first of your text and email automations: someone asks about a car, gets a text back in seconds and an email with what they need to rent, and a follow-up the next day if they have not booked. The card opens under New Inquiry, the first of your headings in the opportunities tab, and texts go out once your GHL number's A2P registration is approved.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_90", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3232, "y": -10, "width": 2092, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1574963608, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 717440071, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_91", "type": "text", "x": 3254, "y": 6, "width": 2048, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1527703408, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 956887592, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - BOOKING CONFIRMED", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - BOOKING CONFIRMED", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_92", "type": "text", "x": 3254, "y": 42, "width": 2048, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1415900355, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 957956675, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "When you confirm the booking, the renter gets the confirmation by text and email with the deposit, the agreement and your rules on tolls and tickets, and you get a task to verify license and insurance before pickup.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "When you confirm the booking, the renter gets the confirmation by text and email with the deposit, the agreement and your rules on tolls and tickets, and you get a task to verify license and insurance before pickup.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_93", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5522, "y": -90, "width": 3136, "height": 458, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 838145800, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1028162214, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_94", "type": "text", "x": 5544, "y": -74, "width": 3092, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1720926263, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 973838694, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - CAR RETURNED", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - CAR RETURNED", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_95", "type": "text", "x": 5544, "y": -38, "width": 3092, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 858641202, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2116481899, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "When the car comes back, the renter gets a thank-you, you get an inspection task that feeds your Vehicles and Maintenance tabs, and two days later the review request goes out unless a claim is open.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "When the car comes back, the renter gets a thank-you, you get an inspection task that feeds your Vehicles and Maintenance tabs, and two days later the review request goes out unless a claim is open.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_96", "type": "rectangle", "x": 8858, "y": -10, "width": 2788, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1527129487, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 124468791, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_97", "type": "text", "x": 8880, "y": 6, "width": 2744, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 119988829, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1200093500, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - ACCIDENT REPORTED", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - ACCIDENT REPORTED", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_98", "type": "text", "x": 8880, "y": 42, "width": 2744, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2028255630, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1113145427, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The renter gets a safety-first text and an email listing everything the claim needs, you get a text, and the card sits in Accident or Claim with a record in your Accidents/Claims tab until it is settled.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The renter gets a safety-first text and an email listing everything the claim needs, you get a text, and the card sits in Accident or Claim with a record in your Accidents/Claims tab until it is settled.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_99", "type": "rectangle", "x": 11844, "y": -90, "width": 3136, "height": 458, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 831698693, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1478675320, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_100", "type": "text", "x": 11866, "y": -74, "width": 3092, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1920828234, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1501175504, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - TICKET RECEIVED", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - TICKET RECEIVED", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_101", "type": "text", "x": 11866, "y": -38, "width": 3092, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1566099206, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 345908636, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Parking, toll and camera tickets show up after the car is back, so this one runs off the renter, not the open rental: ticket details, your admin fee and a payment link, a record in your Tickets tab, and one reminder if it is still unpaid.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Parking, toll and camera tickets show up after the car is back, so this one runs off the renter, not the open rental: ticket details, your admin fee and a payment link, a record in your Tickets tab, and one reminder if it is still unpaid.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 88, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_102"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.